1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720
Ammonia is the starting
point for most nitrogen

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:06,000
fertiliser, made from
nitrogen and hydrogen in the

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,280
Haber process.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,160
Cooling the mixture
and squeezing it both shift

5
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:13,680
the balance toward ammonia,
yet real plants run

6
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:17,440
hot, at about 450 degrees Celsius, and at

7
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:20,800
about 200 atmospheres,
not the thousand that would

8
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,000
give more.

9
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,400
Why choose conditions
that make less ammonia in

10
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,520
