23
00:00:56,814 --> 00:01:00,333
Squeezing shifts toward fewer
gas particles, two against

24
00:01:00,414 --> 00:01:02,493
four, so it does too.

25
00:01:02,574 --> 00:01:05,053
Pulling the ammonia out
leaves the settled mixture

26
00:01:05,134 --> 00:01:06,893
the same, but lets the rest of the

27
00:01:06,974 --> 00:01:10,333
