28
00:01:10,414 --> 00:01:12,733
The catalyst changes only the speed.

29
00:01:13,934 --> 00:01:15,933
But a factory is paid for the ammonia

30
00:01:16,014 --> 00:01:17,933
it makes while the gas flows over its

31
00:01:18,014 --> 00:01:20,573
iron catalyst, not for a mixture that has

32
00:01:20,654 --> 00:01:22,253
