33
00:01:22,574 --> 00:01:24,213
The iron comes next.

34
00:01:24,494 --> 00:01:27,613
Cooling lowers both rates,
because fewer collisions have

35
00:01:27,654 --> 00:01:30,573
enough energy, and nitrogen
molecules are hard to

36
00:01:30,654 --> 00:01:31,213
