59
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,960
Pressure helps both.

60
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:30,200
Squeezing crowds the particles,
so collisions are more

61
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:33,640
frequent and both rates
rise, and it shifts

62
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,640
the balance toward the side with two gas

63
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:36,360
particles.

64
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:39,320
So why not a thousand atmospheres?

65
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:42,440
Each extra bit of pressure buys less extra

66
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:45,880
ammonia, but the thicker
steel, stronger pumps and

67
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:49,000
extra energy cost more each time, and a

68
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,920
