77
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,480
So the gas is cooled until the ammonia

78
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:16,440
turns to a liquid,
called condensing, and is

79
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:19,560
drawn off, while the nitrogen
and hydrogen stay

80
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:20,200
