87
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:39,400
Write it as an exam answer, one condition

88
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,320
at a time: what it does to the

89
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:44,600
yield and why, to the rate and why,

90
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,640
and what limits it.

91
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:49,720
Temperature: the reaction
gives out heat, so cooling

92
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:52,520
raises the yield, but fewer
collisions have enough

93
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,680
energy, so both rates fall.

94
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:57,800
So the plant uses about 450 degrees with

95
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:58,280
