99
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,600
So it uses about 200 atmospheres.

100
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:14,520
Removal: taking the ammonia
out keeps the reverse

101
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:17,640
rate low, so the forward
