124
00:05:17,534 --> 00:05:18,813
Pause here to answer.

125
00:05:29,234 --> 00:05:30,273
Temperature.

126
00:05:30,314 --> 00:05:33,233
The reaction gives out
heat, so cooling shifts

127
00:05:33,314 --> 00:05:36,113
